    "bluetooth_settings_pane_description" : [
      {
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "target" : "Das ist die Ansicht der Bluetooth-Einstellungen, auf der eine Vielzahl von Bluetooth-Aktionen ausgeführt werden kann. Zu einigen der nützlichsten Aktionen zählen das Verbinden, Trennen, Koppeln und Umbenennen von Bluetooth-Geräten.",
        "language" : "de"
      },
      {
        "target" : "This is the Bluetooth settings screen that allows users to perform a multitude of Bluetooth operations. Some of the main useful operations are connecting, disconnecting, forgetting, pairing and renaming Bluetooth devices.",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "en_AU"
      },
      {
        "language" : "ar",
        "target" : "هذه هي شاشة إعدادات bluetooth التي تتيح للمستخدمين القيام بالعديد من عمليات bluetooth. بعض العمليات الرئيسية المفيدة هي توصيل أجهزة bluetooth وفصلها وإلغاء حفظها وإقرانها وإعادة تسميتها.",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings"
      },
      {
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "ja",
        "target" : "これはBluetoothの設定画面で、ユーザがさまざまなBluetooth操作を行うことができます。主な操作項目としては、Bluetoothデバイスへの接続、接続解除、ペアリング解除、ペアリング、および名称変更があります。"
      },
      {
        "language" : "en",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "target" : "This is the bluetooth settings screen that allows users to do a multitude of bluetooth operations.  Some of the main useful operations are connecting, disconnecting, forgetting, pairing, and renaming bluetooth devices."
      },
      {
        "language" : "es_419",
        "target" : "Esta es la pantalla de configuración de Bluetooth que permite a los usuarios realizar varias operaciones útiles, como conectar, desconectar, olvidar, enlazar y cambiar el nombre de dispositivos Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings"
      },
      {
        "language" : "zh_CN",
        "target" : "这是蓝牙设置屏幕，可让用户执行多项蓝牙操作。一些主要的有用操作包括连接、断开连接、忽略、配对和重新命名蓝牙设备。",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Este panel de ajustes Bluetooth te permite realizar muchas operaciones, entre ellas, conectar, desconectar, omitir, enlazar o cambiar de nombre los dispositivos Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "es"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Questa è la schermata delle impostazioni del Bluetooth, che consente di effettuare varie operazioni relative a questa funzionalità. Le più utili permettono di connettere, disconnettere, abbinare, dissociare e rinominare i dispositivi Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "it"
      },
      {
        "language" : "ko",
        "target" : "다양한 Bluetooth 관련 작업을 수행할 수 있는 Bluetooth 설정 화면입니다. 대표적으로 Bluetooth 기기 연결, 연결 해제, 지우기, 페어링 및 이름 변경 등의 작업을 편리하게 수행할 수 있습니다.",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings"
      },
      {
        "target" : "這是藍牙設定畫面，用户可以進行多種藍牙操作。部份主要實用操作包括連接、中斷連接、忘記、配對和重新命名藍牙裝置。",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "zh_HK"
      },
      {
        "language" : "zh_TW",
        "target" : "這是讓使用者進行多元藍牙操作的藍牙設定畫面。部分有用的主要操作包含連接、中斷連接、忘記設定、配對和重新命名藍牙裝置。",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings"
      },
      {
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "target" : "Esta es la pantalla de configuración de Bluetooth que permite a los usuarios realizar varias operaciones útiles, como conectar, desconectar, olvidar, enlazar y cambiar el nombre de dispositivos Bluetooth.",
        "language" : "es_US"
      },
      {
        "target" : "This is the Bluetooth settings screen that allows users to do a multitude of Bluetooth operations.  Some of the more useful operations are connecting, disconnecting, forgetting, pairing and renaming Bluetooth devices.",
        "language" : "en_GB",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings"
      },
      {
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "fr_CA",
        "target" : "Il s’agit de l’écran des réglages Bluetooth qui vous permet d’effectuer une multitude d’opérations Bluetooth. Voici quelques-unes des principales opérations : connecter, oublier, jumeler et renommer un appareil Bluetooth."
      },
      {
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "fr",
        "target" : "Il s’agit de l’écran des réglages Bluetooth qui permet aux utilisateurs de réaliser un grand nombre d’opérations liées au Bluetooth, notamment connecter, déconnecter, oublier, jumeler et renommer des appareils Bluetooth."
      }
